    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457780/extras/94ce45dc481e026274f7225065926367.avif?t=1740805164\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PREPARE TO DIE!</strong><br>In <i>Bone n' Gone</i>, you control a fragile and determined skeleton, ready to defeat the bosses that plague areas perfectly designed for smooth action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOW HEALTH? HIGH REWARD!</strong><br>Be rewarded for risky gameplay, as you deal more damage the less health you have! But be careful, death can be pretty harsh at times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457780/extras/c9973d209c1983f03f735f740ecb3cb3.avif?t=1740805164\" data-has-big width=800 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREATHTAKING SCENARIOS</strong><br>With retro graphics, you\u2019ll admire every detail and carefully placed texture in the game. Featuring references to classic games, we guarantee an interesting gameplay experience with stunning visuals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457780/extras/2bd6fae07981d7256f8b8a4c435f07e2.avif?t=1740805164\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHO WE ARE</strong><br>Gatocalvojogos is here to add to the market's lineup of challenging shooters. With authentic, AI-free art and horrendously passionate code, we\u2019re here to stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457780/extras/90bb9c5010356d2eaaa060816359954f.avif?t=1740805164\" data-has-big width=800 height=126 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457780/extras/94ce45dc481e026274f7225065926367.avif?t=1740805164\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PREPARE TO DIE!</strong><br>In <i>Bone n' Gone</i>, you control a fragile and determined skeleton, ready to defeat the bosses that plague areas perfectly designed for smooth action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOW HEALTH? HIGH REWARD!</strong><br>Be rewarded for risky gameplay, as you deal more damage the less health you have! But be careful, death can be pretty harsh at times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457780/extras/c9973d209c1983f03f735f740ecb3cb3.avif?t=1740805164\" data-has-big width=800 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREATHTAKING SCENARIOS</strong><br>With retro graphics, you\u2019ll admire every detail and carefully placed texture in the game. Featuring references to classic games, we guarantee an interesting gameplay experience with stunning visuals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457780/extras/2bd6fae07981d7256f8b8a4c435f07e2.avif?t=1740805164\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHO WE ARE</strong><br>Gatocalvojogos is here to add to the market's lineup of challenging shooters. With authentic, AI-free art and horrendously passionate code, we\u2019re here to stay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457780/extras/90bb9c5010356d2eaaa060816359954f.avif?t=1740805164\" data-has-big width=800 height=126 /></span></p>",
